    <string name="author_dialog_title">Author Statement</string>
    <string name="author_statement">Boss Timer App.\n\n[Data]\nLocal: stored on device.\nShared: synced via cloud.\n\n[Shared Mode]\n1. Tap "Share" button\n2. Enter auth code on first use\n3. Enter 3-digit room ID + password to join, or create a new room\n\n[Roles]\nOwner: full access (can set Super Admin)\nSuper Admin: same as Owner\nAdmin: edit + reset\nMember: view only\n\n[Float Window]\nShare | Min | Room buttons\n"Share" toggles local/shared view\n"Room" shows info or room list\n☆ on blue bar to favorite rooms\nFavorited rooms appear in room list to join\n\n[Sync]\nOwner/Super Admin changes push instantly\nVersion checked every 60s\nDownload on version change only\n\n[Language]\n🌐 button to switch CN/EN/KO.\n\n[Contact]\nQQ: 1781391759 / 810026494</string>

